 "unstated_details": [
  "pairs = DK t60 main-line pairs from ODDS_HISTORY's pairs_for_season on the stored model_rows/market_rows parquets (pushes dropped, status 0); consensus p is the median multiplicative de-vig at the modal main line, which can differ from DK's line (p_cons_over is NaN when no consensus row exists; LightGBM handles NaN)",
  "game_total = median over books of each book's main total (most balanced prices, ties lower point); spread = median home spread over books, signed to the player's team (home: as is, away: negated); both restricted to book rows with snapshot_ts <= real tip - 60 min; the h2h consensus P(home) is measured in the gate but is not a feature (the draft lists none)",
  "missing game_total -> median of totals of games on EARLIER dates (as-of; null if none), missing spread -> 0.0 (the median of a team-signed spread); both with a *_missing flag",
  "tier = prior-10 points per game over the player's last 10 played games (minutes > 0, strictly before the game, min 1 game): 0 <10, 1 10-17, 2 17-24, 3 24+, -1 no prior game",
  "tag = latest usable T-60 official-report status (production real-tip gate): 0 unlisted, 1 available, 2 probable, 3 questionable, 4 doubtful, 5 out; null when the game has no usable snapshot (never 'nobody listed')",
  "is_b2b = production team_game_context b2b (previous team game yesterday); n_out_rot and starter10 are the stored production feature-frame values on the model rows",
  "stat enters M2/M3 as a numeric code (pts 0, reb 1, ast 2, fg3m 3); one pooled model over the four stats per block",
  "month-block walk-forward: train = every pair row with game_date before the block; odds exist from 2023 only, so the first blocks with fewer than 5,000 training rows are unscored and reported (all arms share the scored rows)",
  "M1 uses the stored ODDS_HISTORY weights w (fit on 2023 DK t60, results_2024.json h2); on 2023 that is in-sample by construction and is reported as such",
  "M4 permutes p_grid_over and z JOINTLY (one permutation per (stat, season)) so their relation to each other survives and only their link to the row's side is broken (seed 0)",
  "pass rule read as: 2023 is the select season (conditions 1-4 on the point estimates and the CI, no Holm), 2024 confirms (all conditions incl. Holm over 4 stats); both must hold",
  "gate check 4 gap = max - min null rate across tiers within a stat and across stats within a tier (cells under 300 rows listed, not judged); also reported pooled",
  "side accuracy: prediction > 0.5 means over; acc_book is the book's own p > 0.5 (same rows)"
 ]
